public projects. Ventris does not bundle their game images or copied source:

* n64decomp/perfect_dark — MIT, as stated by that project.
* ACreTeam/ac-decomp — CC0-1.0, as stated by that project.
* crowded-street/3s-decomp — AGPL-3.0, as stated by that project.
