--------------------------
Ventris vendors Ghidra 12.1.3's decompiler sources and
`third_party/ghidra/typeinfo/generic_clib.gdt`, its C library type archive,
unmodified. It builds the sources into the program it drives; the archive is
data, not source, and is used as-is. Ghidra applies the archive's prototypes to
functions by name, so reproducing Ghidra's output requires the same data.
Ghidra is licensed under Apache-2.0; its own NOTICE attribution follows from
that licence, and every vendored byte is hashed in
third_party/ghidra/MANIFEST.sha256 so the "unmodified" claim is checkable.

See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for the provenance and distribution boundary.
